    "enUS": {
      "description": "Those Twilight's Hammer dogs caught us before we could properly begin our attack. I was able to fight my way out, but my warriors were not so lucky. They were dragged off by the cult's champions and imprisoned in the fortress to the west.\r\n\r\nOrcs do not belong in cages, {class}. Free my brothers and sisters, and we will show these mongrels a real fight.",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Rog'mar Scout rescued",
          "type": "monster"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Rescue 5 Rog'mar Scouts within the Twilight's Shroud for Da'grosh.",
